				<wikidot:authorName>phyrestorm</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>2027488</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>And it comes out as bad English.</p> <p>If I were to write something in Russian, using something that's a thing in English but just doesn't work in Russian, would you be like, &quot;Oh, that's something Russian struggles with,&quot; or would you think, &quot;Damn, her Russian sucks?&quot;</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
