					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-2340205#post-3760278</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-2340205/ars-gratia-artis#post-3760278</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Thu, 05 Apr 2018 16:43:10 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>phyrestorm</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>2027488</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Switching constantly between past and present isn't a tense.</p> <p>This is an interesting tale, but stuff like 'Pretending that he <strong>doesn't</strong> care about the pairs of eyes that are trained on him and the sculpture, the artist <strong>started</strong> to hum a little tune' really detracts from it.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
